OL,3,AMajor review to propose tax, welfare,
OL,4,Aand education changes to get young
OL,5,Apeople into work
OL,6,
OL,7,FA major review will propose widespread
OL,8,Fchanges to tax, welfare, and education
OL,9,Fto help get young people into work
OL,10,Facross the UK
OL,12,FThe government-backed report by Alan
OL,13,FMilburn will be released at 11:30 GMT -
OL,14,Fbut much of the detail is already known
OL,16,FAlmost one million people aged 16 to 24
OL,17,Fare not in education, employment or
OL,18,Ftraining - a rate of 13%, which Milburn
OL,19,Fwants to fall to 5% within a decade
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
